{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛宣布再當父親的方力申（Alex），昨日即參與港澳慈善游，橫渡長達35公里的渡海泳，結果以8小時37分24秒完成壯舉，創下紀錄。</p><p>他受訪時坦言游水時遇大浪及海水降溫，腳掌一度失去知覺，令他感到「死亡威脅」，極之驚險！</p><p>幸最終憑着意志完成，他上岸</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T16:13:53.216781+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T16:00:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_hash":"b1909b1f0e1db402538bd52ea9e91e4cb58aa5cf413456ca77622d665a1475b5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}